OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,FCounter Terrorism Police have referred
OL,8,Fthemselves to the police watchdog
OL,9,Fafter identifying a previously
OL,10,Funexplored line of inquiry in an
OL,11,Fearlier investigation with potential
OL,12,Flinks to the murder of Ann Widdecombe.
OL,14,FWiddecombe, 78, was allegedly hit 21
OL,15,Ftimes over the head with a hammer in a
OL,16,F"planned and targeted" attack carried
OL,17,Fout with a "ferocity of violence", on
OL,18,FJuly 8.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
