OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786184293
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,FJoshua Kerry, 28, from Rotherham,
OL,8,FSouth Yorkshire, was charged with her
OL,9,Fmurder last month.
OL,11,FOn Friday, Counter Terrorism Police
OL,12,Fsaid they had reopened an
OL,13,Finvestigation into an attempted
OL,14,Fburglary reported to the Metropolitan
OL,15,FPolice in April 2025 in connection
OL,16,Fwith their inquiries.
OL,18,FThe attempted burglary at a property
OL,19,Fin Greater London was investigated at
OL,20,Fthe time, and no arrests were made.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
