OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786184293
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,FIt has now been reopened as part of a
OL,8,Fwider investigation into the murder of
OL,9,FMs Widdecombe, as a new line of
OL,10,Finquiry has been identified that had
OL,11,Fnot been previously recognised or
OL,12,Fpursued.
OL,14,FCounter Terrorism Policing London
OL,15,Freferred themselves to the Independent
OL,16,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC) on
OL,17,FFriday over their support to the
OL,18,Finitial investigation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
