PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786184293
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,FAn IOPC spokesperson said: "We can
OL,8,Fconfirm that the IOPC has decided to
OL,9,Findependently investigate the conduct
OL,10,Fof a Counter Terrorism Policing London
OL,11,Fstaff member following a referral
OL,12,Freceived earlier today.
OL,14,F"The conduct relates to an allegation
OL,15,Fthe individual failed to identify and
OL,16,Fpursue a line of enquiry relating to
OL,17,Fan attempted burglary reported in
OL,18,FApril 2025.
OL,26,@oD@\OUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
