PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786184293
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,F"Counter Terrorism Policing London has
OL,8,Fbeen notified of our decision, and no
OL,9,Ffurther information is available at
OL,10,Fthis early stage."
OL,12,FSenior National Coordinator for
OL,13,FCounter Terrorism Policing Vicki Evans
OL,14,Fsaid the victims and families of both
OL,15,Finvestigations had been updated and
OL,16,Fwere receiving support.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
