CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786184293
OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,F"Given the nature of this matter and
OL,8,Fthe significant public interest in the
OL,9,Finvestigation into Ann Widdecombe's
OL,10,Fdeath, it was of critical importance
OL,11,Ffor us to provide this update," she
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,F"We would urge the public, and the
OL,15,Fmedia, to help us to secure justice
OL,16,Ffor those affected, and be mindful
OL,17,Fwhen sharing speculation or
OL,18,Finformation not provided by police."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
