OL,3,CPolice investigating Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cdeath reopen attempted burglary from
OL,5,C2025
OL,7,FMs Widdecombe had been having lunch at
OL,8,Fher home in Devon when Kerry allegedly
OL,9,Fburst into her bungalow and killed
OL,10,Fher, the Old Bailey heard last month.
OL,12,FThe Reform UK spokeswoman and former
OL,13,FTory MP was found dead with "serious
OL,14,Finjuries" the next day.
OL,16,FKerry will next appear at the Old
OL,17,FBailey on October 9 for a case
OL,18,Fmanagement hearing before a further
OL,19,Fplea and trial preparation hearing on
OL,20,FNovember 20.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
